|---|---|---|
| Vision | [`.harness/vision.md`](vision.md) | |
| NFRs | [`.harness/nfrs.md`](nfrs.md) | |
| Requirements source | [`.harness/perpetum.md`](../perpetum.md) | **The only place ids are minted** (Perpetum 0.8, `V-9`) |
