| LM Studio native surface | `/api/v0/models`, `/api/v0/models/{id}`, `/api/v0/chat/completions`, `/api/v0/completions`, `/api/v0/embeddings` | returns `state`, `max_context_length`, `quantization`, `arch`, TTFT and tok/s |
